                                                                                                                                    <customfield id="customfield_10300" key="com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.customfieldtypes:textarea">
                        <customfieldname>Acceptance Criteria</customfieldname>
                        <customfieldvalues>
                            <customfieldvalue>&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Create NEW SQL objects (table, stored procedures) to extract and transform data for the File with the Header and Footer Control Records.&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#de350b&quot;&gt;&lt;ins&gt;&lt;b&gt;new logic requirement:&#160; Issue Date has to be greater or equal to the previous business day (&quot;AsofDate&quot;).&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/ins&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Main&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;Section of the File Fields&lt;/b&gt; include:
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;
		&lt;ul&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;&#160;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ul&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;div class=&apos;table-wrap&apos;&gt;
&lt;table class=&apos;confluenceTable&apos;&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&apos;confluenceTd&apos;&gt;&lt;b&gt;NEW&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;Requirement File Build as of 02/09/2026&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&apos;confluenceTd&apos;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fields Required&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&apos;confluenceTd&apos;&gt;LOCActive_MMDDYYYY&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&apos;confluenceTd&apos;&gt;1.&#160;&lt;font color=&quot;#de350b&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;AsofDate&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
2.Pledge code&lt;br/&gt;
3.Reference Number (unique id, this is needed)&lt;br/&gt;
4.Maturity Date&#160;&lt;br/&gt;
5.Amount&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;All data is at the pledge code level.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Data resides in:&#160;&lt;b&gt;Letter of Credit Collateral Report&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;&lt;b&gt;2.&#160; &lt;font color=&quot;#de350b&quot;&gt;NEW &lt;/font&gt;Control Records Fields Include the&lt;/b&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For the control information (effective date and record count).&#160; We would request that the first record is the effective date, in the format of &quot;HDR&quot;|&quot;YYYYMMDD&quot; and the last record is the record count of data records &quot;TLR&quot;|&quot;0000000001&quot;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;, excluding the first and last record (header/footer).&#160; All data records would be pipe &#8220;|&#8221; delimited&#160; and encapsulated with double quotes.&#160; Include a column record after the header effective date record.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Example record from a different interface to gain an idea of the format:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&quot;HDR&quot;|&quot;20251110&quot;&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&quot;TLR&quot;|&quot;0000000001&quot;&lt;/p&gt;</customfieldvalue>

                        </customfieldvalues>
                    </customfield>
